flowchart LR
  P[Approved screening provider] -->|POST raw callback\nX-Verification-Provider\nX-Verification-Signature-256| G[Go verification orchestrator]
  G --> B[Bounded raw body\n1 MiB maximum]
  B --> H[HMAC-SHA-256\nconfigured provider secret]
  H -->|hmac.Equal mismatch| R401[401 rejected]
  H -->|valid| J[Bounded JSON contract]
  J -->|invalid| R400[400 invalid payload]
  J -->|valid| D[PostgreSQL record_provider_check]
  D --> A[Operator role recheck\ncase FOR UPDATE\ncheck/state/digest validation]
  A --> E[Provider check upsert\nappend-only event\noutbox]
  E -->|persistence issue| R503[503 retryable]
  E -->|recorded| R204[204 no content]
  E --> Q[Human reviewer prerequisite gate]
  Q -->|active consent + all required passed checks| V[verified decision]
  Q -->|otherwise| M[manual review / no verification]
